  "source_ref": "Altera Agilex 5 FPGA E-Series 065B Premium Development Kit production schematic 150-0330713-A3 (2025-09-17): FMC+ connector J34 sheet 42 (rows A-M, Y, Z; every pad label verified against its VITA 57.1/57.4 connector position), Agilex 5 symbol sheets 16 (HSIO bank 3B), 18/19 (HVIO banks 6A/6C/6D), 21 (GTS banks 4B/4C). Cross-checked against UG 814550 Table 21 - note that table's I/O Bank column has 4B and 4C swapped relative to both the schematic and section A.8.4. Excluded: HA/HB (all 92 pads carry an explicit 'Unused' annotation, sheet 42 is captioned 'HPC IO's from Banks A, B not used'); CLK2_BIDIR (reaches the FPGA only through the U419 MIPI/FMC clock mux selected by FMC_MIPI_CLK_SEL, so it is shared with the MIPI FPC connector, not a direct FMC route); FMC JTAG and FMC_PWR_EN / FMC_*_PG (terminate at the MAX 10 system controller, sheet 8); VREF and VADJ pins per repo convention. LA29-LA33 reach HVIO through the sheet-51 1V2<->3V3 level translators; the FPGA-side balls recorded here are the translators' FMC_3V3_LA_* outputs.",
